      <data key="d2">chunk-6b02315423350f3598288e189fbcb8ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STAGE 1A2 CANCER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stage 1A2 cancer is an early-stage cervical cancer with a slightly larger tumor than 1A1 but still confined to the cervix. Treatment may include cone biopsy or radical trachelectomy with pelvic lymph node evaluation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-95c76786e9d6dbf06ddf5d55af0cf658</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OPERATING ROOM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A hospital facility where surgical procedures, such as tumor removal, are performed."&lt;SEP&gt;"A location in a clinic or hospital where TURBT is performed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating room is a location for procedures under anesthesia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating room is a location where direct laryngoscopy is performed under general anesthesia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating room is a location where procedures like direct laryngoscopy and panendoscopy are performed under anesthesia."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating room is a location where surgical biopsies are performed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating room is a location."&lt;SEP&gt;"Operating room is a medical facility location where procedures like cystoscopy and pyelogram are performed under anesthesia."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dea00cf063e8831db4919330d94b1f2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a158766f46bf752d6cdfe95c92f14547&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IDH1&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"IDH1 is a gene or protein that is tested in biomarker testing, with presence indicated by a plus sign and absence by a minus sign."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CERVICAL CANCER AND LEGAL RIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legal rights protect cervical cancer patients from discrimination."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEUKEMIC BLASTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Leukemic blasts are immature white blood cells that are overproduced in leukemia and can be targeted by therapies."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-06f823f3a91fcbc32c62fac3c6347715</data>
    </node>
