      <data key="d2">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOTECH COMPANY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biotech Company is an entity that develops innovative treatments, including immunotherapies for cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biotech company develops diagnostic tests like NGS."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-419f40f64b13b1b2d0fac3cfb9fde92a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THORACIC RADIOLOGIST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A thoracic radiologist is a board-certified doctor who specializes in imaging of the chest, using techniques like X-rays and CT scans to diagnose lung conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thoracic radiologist is a board-certified specialist who interprets imaging of the chest to diagnose lung cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Thoracic radiologist is a doctor who is an expert in imaging of the chest, helping to diagnose lung conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ecc6c4bcd3cab65fa05ab5f3c55e528d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd06bc83e13e7562ce65d6eee1b6024f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADRENAL GLAND CANCER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adrenal gland cancer is a rare type of cancer that affects the adrenal glands, with an incidence of 1 to 2 people per million. It encompasses various tumor types, including adrenocortical carcinoma, neuroblastoma, pheochromocytoma, and adenoma."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7102a43dfb62e649d725bc95ba292688</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SACROILIAC JOINT (SIJ)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sacroiliac joint is the joint connecting the sacrum to the pelvis, relevant for T4 staging in pelvic tumors."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74f18dd51a0091fc888512458a85b0a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IRON OVERLOAD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Iron overload is a condition of too much iron in the body, requiring careful management of supplements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BETA-HUMAN CHORIONIC GONADOTROPIN (Β-HCG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"β-hCG is a tumor marker found in higher amounts in LCOCs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154</data>
    </node>
