    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MTOR INHIBITORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"mTOR inhibitors are drugs that block the mTOR protein to restore effectiveness of endocrine therapy in breast cancer treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPRODUCTIVE ENDOCRINOLOGIST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A reproductive endocrinologist is a doctor specializing in fertility. They may be consulted when fertility-sparing treatment is considered for cervical cancer to assess reproductive options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reproductive endocrinologists are doctors specializing in fertility, who can provide guidance on fertility preservation options."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-95c76786e9d6dbf06ddf5d55af0cf658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COLPOSCOPE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A colposcope is a special magnifying glass used during high-resolution anoscopy to closely examine anal canal tissues for abnormalities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9530f389987c13273449ab22a85170ae</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CD200&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CD200 is a protein found on CLL cells, used to distinguish CLL from other types of lymphoma like mantle cell lymphoma."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EWING SARCOMA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ewing sarcoma is a bone sarcoma that starts in bone marrow."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ewing sarcoma is a type of bone cancer that begins treatment with systemic therapy."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ewing sarcoma is a type of cancer characterized by specific gene fusions, such as EWSR1 with ETS family members, resulting from somatic mutations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ewing sarcoma starts in the bone marrow and commonly occurs in the diaphysis of long bones or flat bones like the pelvis or scapula."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba28a3ce3534c0655a0d08a953d7f038&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30c0bb66b1a2f93e89f5342ab1077451</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPORT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A report is written by a radiologist and sent to the health care provider or patient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Report is a document generated by radiologists or doctors, included in medical binders."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7</data>
    </node>
