    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHITE BLOOD CELL COUNT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"White blood cell count is a measure used to determine if treatment for CLL is needed, with a rapidly rising count indicating a need for intervention."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c</data>
    </node>
