      <data key="d1">"Ribociclib (Kisqali) is a CDK4/6 inhibitor used in systemic therapy to treat cancer by blocking cell cycle progression."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ribociclib is a CDK4/6 inhibitor used with endocrine therapy for hormone receptor-positive, HER2-negative breast cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f</data>
    </node>
