    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LUMBAR PUNCTURE (LP)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lumbar puncture (LP) is a procedure to collect cerebrospinal fluid to check for leukemia cells in the central nervous system."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORGANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Internal body parts palpated during a physical exam to check size, consistency, and pain response."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organs are body parts checked during a physical exam to see if they are of normal size or cause pain."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organs are body parts imaged during tests to detect cancer spread."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organs are internal body parts palpated during physical exam to assess size and consistency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organs are structures in the body, such as adrenal glands, that perform specific functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Organs are structures like kidneys and bladder that can be affected by cancer, and imaging tests assess them for disease extent."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SURROUNDING STRUCTURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Surrounding structures include tissues near the mouth imaged in panoramic dental x-rays."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIVE FEARLESSLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Live fearlessly is a motto encouraging patients to ignore fears from the internet and face their diagnosis with courage."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIAGNOSTIC LABORATORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diagnostic laboratory performs biomarker tests like IHC and FISH."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOOT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soot is a cancer-causing agent that increases lung cancer risk, especially in smokers. It is a black powder produced by incomplete combustion."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TX TUMOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TX tumor indicates the primary tumor cannot be measured."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-74f18dd51a0091fc888512458a85b0a1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLOOD CLOT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Blood clot is a solid mass formed from gel-like blood to stop bleeding, involving coagulation factors."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d73843c009e523101e1464a2b28bc144</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CA 19-9&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CA 19-9 is a tumor marker found in higher amounts in LCOCs."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BCR::ABL1-NEGATIVE OR BCR::ABL1-LIKE B-ALL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This chapter discusses treatment for the most common types of B-ALL, emphasizing clinical trials as the preferred treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TURMERIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Turmeric is an herbal supplement that may interact with systemic therapies, potentially affecting drug efficacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VAPING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vaping is a behavior that is recommended to be stopped to improve treatment outcomes in mouth cancer patients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vaping is a habit involving inhaling nicotine vapor, which similarly increases cancer risk and can hinder treatment outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vaping is a habit involving nicotine that increases cancer risk and can limit treatment effectiveness and wound healing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vaping is a habit involving nicotine that increases cancer risks and can affect treatment outcomes and wound healing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vaping is a habit similar to smoking that can increase risks of lung problems during cancer treatment and other cancers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vaping is the use of e-cigarettes, which can limit cancer treatment effectiveness and increase side effects, necessitating cessation efforts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-28e4e845dfd1390f7f94cfb11bee1526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33608457001e818e2b300adae9c6c0d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOW NEUTROPHILS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Low neutrophils is a condition that can occur in CLL patients, indicating a need for treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEUKEMIA CELLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Leukemia cells are abnormal myeloblasts found in AML, which crowd out healthy blood cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leukemia cells are abnormal myeloblasts produced in AML that crowd out other blood cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leukemia cells are abnormal, malignant white blood cells that proliferate in AML and can be detected in blood or bone marrow."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd7ea43a74059d6781866faec437f19a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENETIC FACTORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genetic factors include inherited genetic changes like BRCA2 mutations that increase the risk of prostate cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6d28b36fe82792dfb86e98ef76b3b04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DENTURES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dentures are dental prosthetics planned using panoramic x-rays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dentures are dental prosthetics that may be planned using panoramic dental x-rays."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CELLS GROWING OUT OF CONTROL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cells growing out of control is the definition of cancer, which applies to primary CNS lymphoma."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REFERENCE LABORATORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Reference laboratory is a specialized lab for complex testing like NGS."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-650982a589c2d527bc13923ccd0569ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SILICA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Silica is a cancer-causing agent that increases lung cancer risk, particularly in occupational settings like mining. It is a mineral found in sand and rock."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7843955573cdc294b34e74019195fafb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DNA SEQUENCING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"DNA sequencing is a lab test used to look for mutations in the TP53 and IGHV genes, which control how cells die when unhealthy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-67015f3916810c4378b2ed269cc27f29</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BCR::ABL1-POSITIVE B-ALL TREATMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This chapter discusses treatment for BCR::ABL1-positive B-ALL, focusing on stopping the activity of the BCR::ABL protein."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b11b0c66441242d2f687a0c55adee585</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GINGKO BILOBA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gingko biloba is an herbal supplement that may interact with systemic therapies, potentially affecting drug efficacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9040f5949ae0ff36ce88faa1f4b67ead</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STAGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Staging is a system used to describe the extent of cancer at diagnosis, including tumor size, lymph node involvement, and metastasis, and is crucial for prognosis and treatment decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is a topic covered in Chapter 3, explaining how bone cancer is staged."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is the process of determining how far cancer has spread, using imaging and other tests to guide treatment planning."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is the process of determining how much cancer has spread, informed by p16 testing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is the process of determining the extent of cancer in the body, based on how far cancer has grown through colon wall layers and lymph node involvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is the process of determining the extent of cancer spread, based on imaging and other test results."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is the process of determining the extent of cancer spread, using tests like imaging and biopsy, to guide treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Staging is the process of determining the extent of cervical cancer spread, guiding treatment decisions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cfcc365cd093374564eb27dcbf5b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa7c7369d88ae71c842152510867223&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be6e1cb2fe11f4d9962741c30d446a69</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IV INFUSIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"IV infusions are a treatment option for CLL, often combined with pills taken for a specific amount of time."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-098a64d7118fc8e1eb3e91ba0124258c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VEIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vein is a blood vessel into which tracers are injected for PET scans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vein is a blood vessel through which blood samples are drawn for tests."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vein is a blood vessel through which contrast solution is administered intravenously during pyelogram or other procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vein is a blood vessel through which systemic chemotherapy drugs are injected for whole-body treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vein is a blood vessel where a needle is placed to draw blood for tests in bladder cancer care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Vein is a blood vessel where tracers are injected for PET scans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7a890e27eba8c63d10f19b85a72fc14a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0a584e54ffa22e1c25f839302bcd727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIET AND LIFESTYLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Diet and lifestyle factors include high-fat diets, smoking, and obesity increasing risk, while fruits, vegetables, and exercise may reduce risk."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6d28b36fe82792dfb86e98ef76b3b04</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRACES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Braces are orthodontic devices planned using panoramic x-rays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Braces are orthodontic devices that may be planned using panoramic dental x-rays."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-50531346164ea7c08dd087a868b3cc2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705ff2bd04b2b58b98187f60f23a659e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ABNORMAL OVERGROWTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Abnormal overgrowth refers to the uncontrolled growth of lymphocytes, leading to lymphoma."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
    </node>
