    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEALTH HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A full health history is a comprehensive record of a patient's medical background, used in the diagnosis of skin cancer to identify risk factors and guide treatment decisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health history encompasses a patient's past and current medical conditions, treatments, symptoms, and medications, which are essential for comprehensive care and risk assessment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Health history is a record of past and current health issues, used to guide treatment decisions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a06038ec84f20e873b9e275a23aea8d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9dc281a303d0d4c5300c0c1c45b739ed</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DETECTION METHODS&quot;">
