      <data key="d2">chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVANCED PRACTICE PROVIDERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Advanced practice providers include nurse practitioners, physician assistants, and certified nurse midwives who help prevent, evaluate, examine, and diagnose human disease, including breast cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTERNATIONAL FEDERATION OF GYNECOLOGY AND OBSTETRICS (FIGO)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"FIGO is an international organization that developed the staging system for cervical cancer, classifying it into stages I through IV based on tumor size, lymph node involvement, and spread."&lt;SEP&gt;"The International Federation of Gynecology and Obstetrics (FIGO) developed a staging system for ovarian cancer, which is used most often."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a86fc5d439d9bfb3845e468a2a551</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BCR::ABL1 GENE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"BCR::ABL1 gene is a genetic abnormality found in some B-ALL cases, leading to the production of the BCR::ABL protein. Treatment aims to stop its activity."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STANDARD TREATMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Standard treatment is the conventional care for cancer, often compared against new treatments in clinical trials and billed to insurance."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard treatment is the usual care for cancer, which may be combined with a placebo or new drug in clinical trials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard treatment refers to conventional cancer therapies that are typically billed to insurance, and may be combined with clinical trial drugs or placebos."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard treatment refers to conventional, approved cancer therapies, often compared against in clinical trials."&lt;SEP&gt;"Standard treatment refers to the conventional therapies used for a cancer type, which clinical trials may compare against or be alternatives to."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-60426652ddf8265bf75caba550026d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6fd03791661f76f6c1a246b2074b2a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ec4d44b145ca896ff1216caa90ce5dd</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TYKERB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tykerb is the brand name for lapatinib, a HER2-targeted inhibitor used in systemic therapy."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANTIRETROVIRAL THERAPY&quot;">
