      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The hepatobiliary system includes the liver, gallbladder, and bile ducts, which work together to produce and transport bile."&lt;SEP&gt;"The hepatobiliary system includes the liver, gallbladder, and bile ducts. It is involved in digestion and bile production, and is the system where primary liver cancer originates."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1</data>
