      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of polyp in the colon that is generally benign and does not typically become cancer, but is mentioned as a type of polyp."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inflammatory polyps are non-cancerous growths in the colon that rarely become cancerous."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inflammatory polyps are non-cancerous growths on the colon or rectum lining that rarely turn into cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inflammatory polyps are non-cancerous growths that rarely become cancer, often associated with inflammation."</data>
