    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INFLAMMATORY BREAST CANCER (IBC)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Inflammatory breast cancer (IBC) is a rare, aggressive cancer where cancer cells block lymph vessels in the skin of the breast, causing redness, swelling, and warmth."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inflammatory breast cancer is a rare and aggressive form of breast cancer that is typically diagnosed at stage 3 or 4, often presenting as invasive ductal carcinoma."&lt;SEP&gt;"Inflammatory breast cancer is a rare and aggressive form of breast cancer where cancer cells block lymph vessels in the skin of the breast, causing redness, swelling, and warmth."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a93aa507dd7d98a02e8ba92d39e3649&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5846f51c2ca4fae54459ce9c50e3e820</data>
    </node>
