      <data key="d1">"Reproductive Specialist Consultation is meeting with a specialist for reproductive health."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-0bd86bf8fc82f14fa5f7f51d924514e7</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belly is a body area where lymph nodes and organs like the spleen may be palpated during physical exam for CLL."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RED BLOOD CELL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Red blood cells are a type of blood cell that carries oxygen throughout the body, formed from blood stem cells."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROGNOSTIC STAGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Prognostic Staging includes anatomic TNM and assumes standard-of-care treatment, divided into clinical and pathologic stages."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prognostic staging includes anatomic TNM and often Epstein-Barr virus (EBV) levels in the blood, assuming standard-of-care treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Prognostic staging includes anatomic TNM plus tumor grade and biomarker status (HER2, ER, PR), assuming standard-of-care treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f05c8ea6f7c7b4ba1fb0ff1c1733980&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28e4e845dfd1390f7f94cfb11bee1526</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSTIPATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Constipation is a common side effect of ovarian cancer surgery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constipation is a common side effect of systemic therapy, including chemotherapy and targeted therapy. It can be managed with dietary changes and medications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Constipation is a side effect of immunotherapy, causing digestive discomfort."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-cd2be7a2ce722f07b19c80e6e1690a8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MENTAL WELLBEING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mental wellbeing is the psychological health of patients, which is important in cancer care and supported by social workers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEUCOVORIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Leucovorin is a chemotherapy drug used in combination with 5-FU and oxaliplatin or cisplatin in regimens like FOLFOX and FOLFCIS for metastatic anal cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Leucovorin is a medication used with 5-FU to enhance its effectiveness in chemotherapy for colon cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CYSTIC DUCT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The cystic duct connects the gallbladder to the common hepatic duct, forming the common bile duct."&lt;SEP&gt;"The cystic duct connects the gallbladder to the common hepatic duct."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REGROWTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Regrowth is a property of bone, as it can regrow."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FUNGI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fungi are pathogens that the body fights off with a healthy immune system; a weakened immune system increases susceptibility to fungal infections."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHAPTER TESTS FOR BLADDER CANCER INHERITED CANCER RISK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This is a section of the document explaining inherited cancer risk for bladder cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-68217ea9e5382d1756c99b5152ea98db</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ABSORPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Absorption is the process by which nutrients pass from the digestive tract into the bloodstream. It primarily occurs in the small intestine."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5fdcf47f3da06d3e0213112c96eb93d4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GROIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Area of the body examined for enlarged lymph nodes during a physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is a body area where lymph nodes are examined for signs of cancer spread."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is a body area where lymph nodes are felt for enlargement during a physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is a body area where lymph nodes may be palpated during physical exam for CLL."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is a body part where lymph nodes are felt for enlargement during a physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is a location where lymph nodes are checked for enlargement during physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is a part of the body where lymph nodes can be felt for enlargement, as mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is an area checked for enlarged lymph nodes during physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Groin is the area where the thigh meets the abdomen, relevant to lymph node involvement in anal cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The groin is a part of the body where high numbers of lymph nodes are found."&lt;SEP&gt;"The groin is an anatomical area where lymph nodes are located and targeted during radiation therapy for anal cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The groin is the area where the thigh meets the abdomen. It contains inguinal lymph nodes, which are a common site for anal cancer spread."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dc31077c053f79ff82959575d335956&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a18089523f6dcd63cfa5664dc1c01618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4cea71149e0e4157126efdaa0ea3e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d47a420aa2acde1175ad95bf6dc2e664&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7bdde77ad1be3ee9308db3c7703674b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d67bee20d5e5400994f8c8f03052dd06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0bad5ee25cb854c10bdbc9d33b54a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697db1653f51e966e79b92eefeb01ec6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHITE BLOOD CELL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"White blood cells are a type of blood cell that fight infections and are counted in a differential."&lt;SEP&gt;"White blood cells are a type of blood cell that fights infection, including lymphocytes, which are affected in ALL."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9fa573748870dc50a98a935843997c68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5bc83f5f4f3e29b7f0a6f4787c3ad83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLINICAL STAGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Clinical staging is a type of prognostic staging based on information from physical exams, imaging, and biopsies before surgery."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fc469adbdd7a41816d59f249439bc726</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLOOD CLOTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Blood clots are a side effect of bladder removal surgery, posing risks that need monitoring and prevention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood clots in the legs and lungs are linked to high-grade gliomas, causing leg swelling, chest pain, and shortness of breath."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood clots, also known as deep vein thrombosis, are a risk after surgery and cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-541f1323a24c5990b4a6408e0c5442ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf2d987135a5936876bc819136e3a5b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c7ff3a71e74b3f0eb59258541e739e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMOTIONAL WELLBEING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emotional wellbeing is the emotional health of patients, which is important in cancer care and supported by social workers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOLFOX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"FOLFOX is a chemotherapy regimen combining 5-FU, leucovorin, and oxaliplatin, used as first-line therapy for metastatic anal cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"FOLFOX is a chemotherapy regimen combining 5-FU, leucovorin, and oxaliplatin, used for high-risk colon cancers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMON BILE DUCT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GEO"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The common bile duct is formed by the union of the common hepatic duct and cystic duct, carrying bile to the small intestine."&lt;SEP&gt;"The common bile duct is formed by the union of the common hepatic duct and cystic duct."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIGHTNESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lightness is a property of bone, being light yet strong."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEALTH RISKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Health risks are potential adverse outcomes, such as infections and cancers, that increase when the immune system is weakened."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3821a6febf2d21784059ac62a6e659c1</data>
