    <node id="&quot;RADIOACTIVE IODINE (RAI) THERAPY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Radioactive iodine (RAI) therapy uses iodine-131 to selectively destroy thyroid cancer cells that absorb iodine, often used after thyroidectomy for high-risk or metastatic disease."&lt;SEP&gt;"Radioactive iodine therapy is a treatment used after total thyroidectomy to kill remaining cancer cells, often part of thyroid cancer management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Radioactive iodine therapy is a treatment used after total thyroidectomy to kill remaining thyroid cancer cells, recommended based on factors like tumor size, invasion, lymph node spread, and thyroglobulin levels."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b8a273f96e02707e2e87fc43353ed57f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e017cd4fd8af1ebbcb582a93fbfe1ea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e74c94f9f2ff33172671e8742338c6d1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BLOOD PRESSURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Blood Pressure is a vital sign measuring the force of blood against artery walls, checked during physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood pressure is a body function regulated by thyroid hormones."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood pressure is a physiological parameter controlled by hormones produced by the kidneys."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood pressure is a vital sign checked during a physical exam to assess cardiovascular health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood pressure is a vital sign checked during physical exam to assess cardiovascular health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood pressure is a vital sign measured during a physical exam to assess cardiovascular health."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood pressure is regulated by hormones like aldosterone, produced by the adrenal cortex."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-82c7205fc2067a4d00e43fd22276db22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69e63736c94b8b08a565c3d8679d3b57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-717174ace5855cc823d51c46c9a70648&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-48e138ec8da954a5667dc785e919c86b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-711bee9440e11d7c737bc4a49b880910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18b5e32980f3efa0cd012e2abab9b9fc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PLATELET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Platelets are a type of blood cell that helps with blood clotting, formed from blood stem cells."</data>
