      <data key="d1">"5-FU and mitomycin is a chemotherapy regimen used in addition to radiation for anal cancer that returns to lymph nodes when no prior radiation was given."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5349eed06f06d7c9bcb541ced69e4664</data>
    </node>
