      <data key="d2">chunk-e90bcd28496f1f39a21973656e3e496f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANASTOMOTIC LEAK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anastomotic leak is a possible complication of colectomy, involving leaking from the spot where the colon was reconnected."&lt;SEP&gt;"Anastomotic leak is a potential complication after colectomy where the reconnected colon leaks, requiring medical attention."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b5cfcc365cd093374564eb27dcbf5b82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1c1687a8a20b9c451956cf8bba241cc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEPATITIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hepatitis is a risk factor for liver cancer, referring to inflammation of the liver often caused by viral infections."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hepatitis is a type of liver disease caused by viruses such as HBV and HCV. It can be chronic and lead to cirrhosis, liver failure, and liver cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Hepatitis is inflammation of the liver, often caused by viral infections, and is a risk factor for liver cancer."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-84367cc8f7a94b97b4b66a1ca127c15f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4bc8b1b941d18ac455e5f255e1df8c1</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;METASTASIZE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Metastasize is the process of cancer spreading to other parts of the body."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metastasize means to spread to other parts of the body, as cancer can do."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metastasize refers to the spread of cancer to other parts of the body, such as the spine or brain, which can be detected through MRI scans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f8eae4d6dadf6a6fbd339efa4dec2172&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-121b68d5de585c87804c9bce3cdc71eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2778e34af702d49d5e70867726e14b2</data>
    </node>
