      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Breathing Rate is a vital sign measuring the number of breaths per minute, checked during physical exam."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breathing rate is a vital sign checked during a physical exam to assess respiratory function."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breathing rate is a vital sign checked during physical exam to assess respiratory function."&lt;SEP&gt;"Breathing rate is the number of breaths per minute, assessed during a physical exam."</data>
