      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The CDC is a U.S. public health agency that provides breast cancer screening and prevention programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CDC provides guidelines and programs for cervical cancer prevention and screening."</data>
