      <data key="d1">"Painful urination is a side effect of brachytherapy, causing discomfort during urination."&lt;SEP&gt;"Painful urination is a symptom of bladder cancer, involving discomfort or pain during urination."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-d04ad65c55d0dbbee5061cf3b24030ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8aa2c7020ce6e89888e81972588726e3</data>
