    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TUMOR PROFILING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CATEGORY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of biomarker testing that analyzes the genetic and molecular characteristics of a tumor to guide treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is a comprehensive analysis of a tumor's genetic makeup, guiding personalized treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is a method of analyzing genetic changes in cancer cells, synonymous with molecular testing in AML."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is a term for biomarker testing that identifies genetic mutations and proteins in tumors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is a type of biomarker testing that analyzes tumor genes or proteins to identify treatment options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is a type of genetic testing that analyzes the specific genetic changes in AML cells to guide treatment."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is another name for biomarker testing, analyzing tumor characteristics."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is another term for biomarker testing, identifying genetic mutations in tumors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor profiling is another term for biomarker testing."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b63f0a9aec8d42c8426ded05a9bf92b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96238b4b361e393ff452a09d1ce26154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-562e1870b5e20f8648a2e56d960a1148&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d609bd1a55d409470c55ad55e2d125d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea7b3f83164304ee4a562046eb0f5033&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0739b33959299ea67072f390ce38bffd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3ba7430f3a31330247f52afe7e9c68a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0786666c65b5bf00705439d5cb60d5a0</data>
    </node>
