      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The FDA approves vaccines and treatments for cervical cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The FDA is a U.S. regulatory agency that approves drugs and devices for breast cancer treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b4d036ee5fd77783b9e7ddef3a8477ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5</data>
