    <edge source="&quot;BCR::ABL1&quot;" target="&quot;CHROMOSOME 9&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BCR::ABL1 is formed when a piece of chromosome 9 breaks off and switches with chromosome 22."</data>
      <data key="d5">"genetic translocation, formation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ef6586b896c47b361bf4f6aabb4c35d5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;BCR::ABL1&quot;" target="&quot;CHROMOSOME 22&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"BCR::ABL1 is formed when a piece of chromosome 22 breaks off and switches with chromosome 9, creating the Philadelphia chromosome."</data>
      <data key="d5">"genetic translocation, formation"</data>
