      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"If the bladder is removed during pelvic exenteration, a continent urinary diversion may be created as an alternative to an ileal conduit, allowing urine to be drained via catheter without an external bag."</data>
      <data key="d5">"surgical procedures, urinary diversion"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317</data>
    </edge>
