      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Metastatic cervical cancer is typically treated with systemic therapy, with the goal of keeping the cancer under control and preventing further spread."&lt;SEP&gt;"Systemic therapy is the main treatment approach for metastatic cervical cancer, using drugs that travel through the bloodstream."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cancer treatment, disease management"&lt;SEP&gt;"treatment approach"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d0e32bdc49dbab9c2c953abf363e317</data>
