      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cemiplimab is a preferred immunotherapy option for metastatic cervical cancer without specific biomarkers in second-line or beyond treatment."</data>
      <data key="d5">"immunotherapy treatment"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-8ba71a5181f3814dffb21d3399441bea</data>
