      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Cervical cancer can spread to the liver, resulting in metastatic disease."&lt;SEP&gt;"Metastatic cervical cancer can spread to the liver, where local therapies may be used to treat tumors."</data>
