      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"HIV infection is a risk factor for anal cancer, often due to immunosuppression."&lt;SEP&gt;"HIV infection weakens the immune system, making it harder to clear HPV infection, thereby increasing the risk of anal cancer."</data>
