      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"CBC is a key test for AML, showing low counts of healthy blood cells or high abnormal white blood cells."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CBC is a key blood test used to diagnose AML by measuring blood cell levels and detecting abnormal white blood cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">"diagnosis, blood cell counts"&lt;SEP&gt;"diagnostic testing, blood analysis"</data>
