      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Genetic testing identifies gene mutations and abnormal chromosomes in AML, which helps determine the leukemia's aggressiveness and treatment options."&lt;SEP&gt;"Genetic testing is used to identify mutations and chromosomal changes in AML cells to guide treatment and prognosis."&lt;SEP&gt;"Genetic testing is used to learn about the subtype of AML, target treatment, and determine prognosis by looking for changes in leukemia cells."</data>
      <data key="d5">"genetic analysis, cancer management"&lt;SEP&gt;"genetic analysis, treatment guidance"&lt;SEP&gt;"genetic profiling, treatment guidance"</data>
