      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A patient's medical history helps the care team understand past health issues and treatments, which is important for planning AML care."&lt;SEP&gt;"Medical history is used to determine the best treatment for AML, as it provides a record of health issues and treatments."</data>
