      <data key="d4">"Laryngeal cancer is a different type of throat cancer that should not be confused with NPC."</data>
      <data key="d5">"cancer differentiation, medical distinction"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c9383db20cd696688798a193862cb5cc</data>
