      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Primary CNS lymphoma is a cancer that specifically affects the central nervous system, including the brain and spinal cord."</data>
      <data key="d5">"disease location, pathology"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a0d4d6b091e033fd01aa721422b68ef5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;PRIMARY CNS LYMPHOMA&quot;" target="&quot;NEUROLOGICAL EXAM&quot;">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A neurological exam is an important test to diagnose primary CNS lymphoma by assessing brain and nervous system function."&lt;SEP&gt;"A neurological exam is used to assess symptoms that may be related to primary CNS lymphoma, such as balance and coordination issues."</data>
      <data key="d5">"diagnosis, testing"&lt;SEP&gt;"diagnostic process, symptom assessment"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a0d4d6b091e033fd01aa721422b68ef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4966a628b12ecec4187796598764cf23</data>
