      <data key="d3">13.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Blood tests are used to help diagnose primary CNS lymphoma and rule out other conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Blood tests help establish the extent of primary CNS lymphoma and provide information for treatment planning."</data>
