      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Chemotherapy is a main treatment for primary CNS lymphoma, used to slow down growth and reduce symptoms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Primary CNS lymphoma is treated with chemotherapy, which is a primary treatment method for this cancer type."</data>
      <data key="d5">"treatment, cancer management"&lt;SEP&gt;"treatment, disease management"</data>
