      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Stem cell rescue is a treatment option for primary CNS lymphoma, used after other treatments or in cases of relapse."&lt;SEP&gt;"Stem cell rescue is an essential part of chemotherapy treatment for primary CNS lymphoma."</data>
      <data key="d5">"treatment, recovery"&lt;SEP&gt;"treatment, supportive care"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a65ba958750476cc543741efe815c7c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-725b48dc82aad42ba3dc14f4b5207551</data>
