    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;TUMOR&quot;" target="&quot;CANCER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A tumor can be cancerous, and primary CNS lymphoma is a type of cancer."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumors are abnormal growths that may be cancerous and are detected and characterized through imaging and biopsy."</data>
