      <data key="d3">27.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The T in TNM describes the tumor's size and extent, linking the tumor to the staging system."&lt;SEP&gt;"The tumor's size and depth are measured and assigned a T score in the TNM system."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tumor size and extension are scored as 'T' in the TNM system."</data>
      <data key="d5">"staging, tumor assessment"&lt;SEP&gt;"staging, tumor description"&lt;SEP&gt;"tumor classification, staging"</data>
